    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;16.26</strong> Summary of the main features of glucagon cell hyperplasia and neoplasia<u style=\"text-underline: words;\"></u></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
